PTX CoWW+surface+async-bulk
"One thread stores 1 to global g through a surface view, then copies shared s (2) to g with cp.async.bulk and waits for it. The copy's implicit proxy fence (9.7.9.25.2, D20) is between the generic and the async proxies; nothing orders the surface store with the copy's write (8.6), so the surface store may come last: allowed."
{
g=0;
t @ surface aliases g;
s=2 @cta 0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                           ;
 sust.weak t, 1                                     ;
 cp.async.bulk.global.shared::cta.bulk_group g, s   ;
 cp.async.bulk.commit_group                         ;
 cp.async.bulk.wait_group 0                         ;
exists
(g == 1)
